+	.string "STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}, I'd like you to\n"
+	.string "have this.\p"
+	.string "It's a ticket for a ship to an island\n"
+	.string "where a meteorite is said to have\l"
+	.string "fallen long ago.$"
+
+MeteorFalls_StevensCave_Text_CtrShowItAtLilycove:
+	.string "STEVEN: Show it at the port of\n"
+	.string "LILYCOVE CITY.\p"
+	.string "Who knows what you'll find there…\n"
+	.string "I'd love to hear about it.$"
+
